WEBVTT

00:00:00.334 --> 00:00:01.834 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
Where could floodwater go?

00:00:03.334 --> 00:00:05.258 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
I’m a student, and I built TerraScope

00:00:05.258 --> 00:00:08.108 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
to explore that question
along Bihar’s Gandak River.

00:00:10.334 --> 00:00:13.534 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
I scrub from 28 September to 2 October.

00:00:14.058 --> 00:00:16.210 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
ERA5 reconstructs rainfall.

00:00:16.478 --> 00:00:18.490 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
GLOFAS models river flow.

00:00:18.753 --> 00:00:21.517 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
The landscape stays fixed
as the readings change.

00:00:23.334 --> 00:00:27.269 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
In Explore, the terrain screen
flags low spots near Sonepur.

00:00:27.793 --> 00:00:29.932 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
A field team can use this list
to decide where

00:00:29.932 --> 00:00:32.247 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
to survey for temporary water storage.

00:00:33.334 --> 00:00:35.258 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
I open 1 depression
and check its footprint

00:00:35.258 --> 00:00:37.574 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
and estimated volume
up to the spill rim.

00:00:38.098 --> 00:00:40.393 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
The card shows that usable storage
is still unknown

00:00:40.393 --> 00:00:42.367 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
and suitability is unassessed.

00:00:45.334 --> 00:00:48.174 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
The cross-section shows
where the terrain dips.

00:00:48.698 --> 00:00:51.047 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
Before relying on it,
I’d ask a field team

00:00:51.047 --> 00:00:54.087 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
to survey the ground and check
how water actually drains.

00:00:55.334 --> 00:00:57.608 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
I asked my AI agent to deploy TerraScope

00:00:57.608 --> 00:00:59.834 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
with Embarko and give me a public link.

00:01:00.358 --> 00:01:02.509 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
The agent built and deployed
the prototype,

00:01:02.509 --> 00:01:04.305 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
so someone else can open the same map

00:01:04.305 --> 00:01:05.872 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
and inspect the evidence.

00:01:09.334 --> 00:01:11.824 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
Try TerraScope at the address on screen.

00:01:12.348 --> 00:01:14.718 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
Replay the dates, open a candidate,

00:01:14.718 --> 00:01:16.598 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
and see what you’d check in the field.
